From a4e5bc83214c90f19d324704bd90d6a0ea1aacd6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: R <github.overboard312@passmail.net>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 07:55:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] tools: a test whose main never runs fails, and a
 factory flag among others is refused

The pre-js reads main as finished only once the glue has called it, through a wrapper of the glue's callMain: a program linked with -sINVOKE_RUN=0, whose main nothing calls, no longer passes having run nothing. node_test_demo's main_never_called pins it with 1 and the line. The refusal of -sMODULARIZE and -sEXPORT_ES6 splits a link-flag value into its flags, so that one among others ("-sJSPI -sMODULARIZE") is refused too.
---
